  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of the infinite series\n$1+\\frac{5}{6}+\\frac{12}{6^2}+\\frac{22}{6^3}+\\frac{35}{6^4}+\\frac{51}{6^5}+\\frac{70}{6^6}+\\ldots .$. is equal\nto:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{425}{216}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{429}{216}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{288}{125}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{280}{125}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let $S=1+\\frac{5}{6}+\\frac{12}{6^2}+\\frac{22}{6^3}+\\frac{35}{6^4}+\\ldots$    .....(i)\n$\\frac{S}{6}=\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{5}{6^2}+\\frac{12}{6^3}+\\frac{22}{6^4}+\\ldots$  ....(ii)\nOn subtracting (i) from (ii)\n$\\frac{5}{6} S=1+\\frac{4}{6}+\\frac{7}{6^2}+\\frac{10}{6^3}+\\frac{13}{6^4}+\\cdots$\n$\\frac{5}{36} S=\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{4}{6^2}+\\frac{7}{6^3}+\\frac{10}{6^4}+\\frac{13}{6^5}+\\cdots$\non subtraction\n$\\frac{25}{36} S=1+\\frac{3}{6}+\\frac{3}{6^2}+\\frac{3}{6^3}+\\ldots=\\frac{8}{5}$\n$S=\\frac{8}{5} \\times \\frac{36}{25}=\\frac{288}{125}$"
  }
}